<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6872" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναλάμπω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>flame up, take fire,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				5.1.16
			</span></i>; <i>shine out,</i> of the sun, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>CP</u>
				4.13.6
			</span></i>: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκτῖνες ἀρετῆς ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					1.335
				</span></i>
			; <i>flame up,</i> of envy, <i><span class="en">
				Jul.
			</span></i><i>ad Ath.</i><i><span class="en">
				274d
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> metaph.,
				<i>break out,</i> as war, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Sull.</u>
				6
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				7
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of a person,
				<i>come to oneself again, revive,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Brut.</u>
				15
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				2.694f
			</span></i>; <i>blaze up</i> with enthusiasm, <i><span class="en">
				Philostr.
				<u>VA</u>
				5.30
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> trans.,
				<i>cause to shine,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Alex.</u>
					30
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λιθοκαλλέα μορφήν,</span> of a
			sculptor, <i><span class="en">
				<u>App.Anth.</u>
				2.534
			</span></i> (Halic.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>illummate,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ζοφερόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Heraclit.
					<u>Ep.</u>
					6.3
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
